  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Healing Hands Shelter for the Vulnerable</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Whilst carrying out their daily activities it has been proven that the need for shelter just not solely lie with women and children. There is a great number of street dwellers within our Metro, people that have unfortunately become victims of circumstance, due to financial constraints, substance abuse, victims of violence or disaster and are now unfortunately homeless.  seeing the great improvement the Shelter for women and children has established, we have undertaken to open a fulltime shelter</narrative>
  </description>
